creatures:
- name: Vampire Spawn
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 16  
      **Hit Points** 90 (rollable(dice=12d8 + 36,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Initiative) (13)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=16)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=12)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+1,label=+1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Resistances** necrotic  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 13  
      **Languages** Common plus one other language  
      **Challenge** 5 (1,800 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Traits

      ***Spider Climb.*** The vampire can climb difficult surfaces, including along ceilings, without needing to make an ability check.

      ***Vampire Weakness.*** The vampire has these weaknesses:

      > ***Forbiddance.*** The vampire can't enter a residence without an invitation from an occupant.
      >
      > ***Running Water.*** The vampire takes 20 Acid damage if it ends its turn in running water.
      >
      > ***Stake to the Heart.*** The vampire is destroyed if a weapon that deals Piercing damage is driven into the vampire's heart while the vampire has the ***Incapacitated*** condition.
      >
      > ***Sunlight.*** The vampire takes 20 Radiant damage if it starts its turn in sunlight. While in sunlight, it has ***Disadvantage*** on attack rolls and ability checks.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The vampire makes two Claw attacks and uses Bite.

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=2d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage. If the target is a Medium or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 13) from one of two claws.

      ***Bite.*** *Constitution Saving Throw:* DC 14, one creature within 5 feet that is willing or that has the ***Grappled***, ***Incapacitated***, or ***Restrained*** condition. *Failure:* rollable(dice=1d4+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage plus rollable(dice=3d6,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Necrotic damage. The target's ***Hit Point*** maximum decreases by an amount equal to the Necrotic damage taken, and the vampire regains ***Hit Points*** equal to that amount.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Deathless Agility.*** The vampire takes the Dash or Disengage action.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Small Medium Undead, Neutral Evil*  
    **Challenge** 5
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024vampirespawn
  status: 1

